  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk  | Meredith, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Residents   \t\t\t \n     Visitors   \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nGovernment \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk \t\t \r\nNOTICE RESIDENTS OF THE TOWN OF MEREDITH \nPrimary Results:    September 8, 2026 Results \nMission Statement \nThe Office of the Town Clerk is dedicated to serving our community with professionalism, efficiency, and a welcoming spirit. We strive to provide accurate information, exceptional service, and a wide range of essential services to meet the needs of our residents and visitors alike. \nFunctions \nVehicle registration \nDog licenses \nVital record requests \nVoter registration/Absentee ballots/Party change requests \nElections \nOaths of office \nMaintaining town records \nMarriage licenses \nAqua-therm permits \nWetlands permitting \nNotary services \nFacility Use Permits \nGeneral questions and payments \nImportant Notices \nTown Clerk's Office will not open until 10:30am on Friday April 10th \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\t\t\tKerri A. Parker, CTC, CDTC\r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail Kerri Parker  \r\nPhone:  603-677-4203 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 41 Main Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Meredith ,  NH   03253 \r\n41 Main Street  Meredith NH 03253 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone: 603-677-4203 | 603-677-4204 \r\nHours \nMonday through Friday  \n8 a.m. to 5 p.m. \r\nDirectory \r\n\t\t\t Aqua-Therm Permits \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Establish Legal Residency \r\n\t\t\t Facility Use Permits \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Online Options \r\n\t\t\t Past Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Register to Vote \r\n\t\t\t Registrations - Motor Vehicle and Boat \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records - Birth, Death, Divorce, and Marriage Certificates \r\n\t\t\t\t Vital Records-Birth, Death, Divorce, and Marriage Certificates \r\n\t\t\t Stay Connected \r\n\t\t\t Online Services \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t FAQ \r\n\t\t\t Public Records \r\n\t\t\t Job Opportunities \r\nContact Us \r\nMeredith Town Hall \r\n41 Main Street \r\nMeredith, NH 03253  \r\nPhone: 603-279-4538 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Current Weather \n         Boat Launch Information \n         Athletic Fields, Beaches, Courts, Parks and Trails \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Visitor's Guide \n         Contact Us \n         Site Map \n         Website Disclaimer \n         Copyright Notices \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
